{
  "_doc": "Step 7B condition types. loss = share of the part's maxHealth lost per severity point (part health is DERIVED from active conditions, so healing a condition gives the health back). heal.base + heal.perSev * initialSeverity = game hours to full healing at HEAL_TIME_SCALE=1. naturalMax: rest and time only heal it while severity <= naturalMax (above that it needs outside help: treatment or a future RPG cure). healFloor: natural healing stops at this severity. requires: above this severity the condition does not heal at all unless the flags are present (anyOf / allOf). surface/feel: [[maxSeverity, text]] for onlookers / the patient; {part} is the part's name. destroyAt: severity at which the part counts as destroyed. sequelae roll when the condition resolves (type, chance, minSeverity, optional when: 'untreated' | 'poor' for badly set/untreated, parts: limb kinds). curableBy: tags of future cures that can remove the permanent result.",
